{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Do you enjoy puzzles but hesitate because they always feel too difficult?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>No more fear of puzzles!</strong></i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hacking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must hack the virus into the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/9fa887bb8e91b94a4aaf56782819fc3a.poster.avif?t=1758858725\" width=780 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/9fa887bb8e91b94a4aaf56782819fc3a.webm?t=1758858725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/9fa887bb8e91b94a4aaf56782819fc3a.mp4?t=1758858725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Springs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place springs along the path you imagine for the virus and design its trajectory to complete the hack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/7d63859a5ed109701ed3c4e2995cdca0.poster.avif?t=1758858725\" width=780 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/7d63859a5ed109701ed3c4e2995cdca0.webm?t=1758858725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/7d63859a5ed109701ed3c4e2995cdca0.mp4?t=1758858725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Single Answer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single solution to hacking. The only goal is to guide the virus into the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the truth, the answer, and the solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/3f9cf15aed567da28fea50466b136506.poster.avif?t=1758858725\" width=780 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/3f9cf15aed567da28fea50466b136506.webm?t=1758858725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/3f9cf15aed567da28fea50466b136506.mp4?t=1758858725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome the obstacles that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid multiple viruses, lasers, gravity, and surface gravity by any means necessary to achieve your hack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/86071843cd4d983bdaab6d147f52e6f7.poster.avif?t=1758858725\" width=780 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/86071843cd4d983bdaab6d147f52e6f7.webm?t=1758858725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/86071843cd4d983bdaab6d147f52e6f7.mp4?t=1758858725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fun of the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Computer viruses can be solved through trial and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeated failures will inevitably lead to success\u2014keep pushing forward endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/924748e87bf08f1552d515464dbbd32d.poster.avif?t=1758858725\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/924748e87bf08f1552d515464dbbd32d.webm?t=1758858725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/extras/924748e87bf08f1552d515464dbbd32d.mp4?t=1758858725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the end,</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple game where all you need to do is hack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hacking with no fixed answers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle that brings you closer to the solution with every failure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various obstacles and gimmicks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confidence and a sense of accomplishment in solving!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Think, experiment, try, and prove that your way is the right way!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967980?t=1758858725","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967980?t=1758858725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/102a0853d915818a1e8dadbbd5d1a2da4a8fdfc3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758858725","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967980/102a0853d915818a1e8dadbbd5d1a2da4a8fdfc